#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course demonstrates workflows that leverage quantum and high "
"performance computing."
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng kursong ito ang mga workflow na gumagamit ng quantum at high "
"performance computing."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-"
"performance-computing/index/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-"
"performance-computing/index/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course provides an overview of classical and quantum resources as well "
"hybrid workflows with examples.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay nagbibigay ng pangkalahatang-tanaw ng mga klasikal at "
"quantum na resources, pati na rin ang mga hybrid workflow na may mga "
"halimbawa.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Inirerekomendang background {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for two distinct groups of individuals: those with "
"backgrounds in quantum computing but not in HPC, and those with backgrounds "
"in HPC but not quantum computing. These technologies complement each other, "
"and those with expertise in one are increasingly aware of the importance of "
"the other. Learners can skip over sections in their own area of expertise as"
" appropriate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay para sa dalawang magkaibang grupo ng mga tao: ang mga may"
" background sa quantum computing ngunit wala sa HPC, at ang mga may "
"background sa HPC ngunit wala sa quantum computing. Ang mga teknolohiyang "
"ito ay nagpupunan sa isa't isa, at ang mga may kaalaman sa isa ay lalong "
"nagiging mulat sa kahalagahan ng isa pa. Maaaring laktawan ng mga mag-aaral "
"ang mga seksyon na nasa sarili nilang larangan ng kaalaman kung angkop.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend that learners complete the following prerequisite prior to this"
" course:\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda naming kumpletuhin ng mga mag-aaral ang sumusunod na paunang "
"kinakailangan bago ang kursong ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up your local environment by following along with the [Get "
"started](/guides/) guide in our documentation page.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang iyong lokal na kapaligiran sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa gabay "
"na [Magsimula](/guides/) sa aming pahina ng dokumentasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a deeper understanding of quantum information, complete this optional course:\n"
"- [Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) with John Watrous.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mas malalim na pag-unawa sa quantum information, kumpletuhin ang opsyonal na kursong ito:\n"
"- [Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) kasama si John Watrous.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Pagsusulit {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Integrating Quantum and High-Performance Computing, "
"take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after "
"reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be "
"notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang makuha ang iyong badge para sa Integrating Quantum and High-"
"Performance Computing, kumuha ng pagsusulit sa IBM&reg; Training. Ang "
"pagsusulit na ito ay nilayon na kunin pagkatapos mabasa ang mga aralin sa "
"kursong ito. Pagkatapos mong maipasa ang pagsusulit, mabibigyan ka ng abiso "
"ng Credly na nakakuha ka ng badge.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Exam](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-"
"computing/exam)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Pagsusulit](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-"
"computing/exam)\n"

