#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Credly {#credly}"
msgstr "Credly {#credly}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor "
"authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the "
"administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an "
"IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge"
" earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification "
"from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal "
"information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and "
"operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with "
"IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner "
"consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be "
"viewed [here.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) IBM employees can view "
"the IBM Internal Privacy Statement "
"[here.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
msgstr ""
"PAUNAWA: Gumagamit ang IBM ng mga serbisyo ng Credly, isang third-party na "
"data processor na awtorisado ng IBM at matatagpuan sa Estados Unidos, upang "
"tumulong sa pangangasiwa ng IBM Digital Badge program. Upang makapagbigay sa"
" iyo ng IBM Digital Badge, ang iyong personal na impormasyon (pangalan, "
"email address, at badge na natamo) ay ibabahagi sa Credly. Makakatanggap ka "
"ng email notification mula sa Credly na may mga tagubilin para sa pag-claim "
"ng badge. Ginagamit ang iyong personal na impormasyon upang maibigay ang "
"iyong badge at para sa pag-uulat ng programa at mga layuning operasyonal. "
"Maaaring ibahagi ng IBM ang personal na impormasyong nakolekta sa mga "
"subsidiary ng IBM at mga third party sa buong mundo. Pangangasiwaan ito nang"
" naaayon sa mga kasanayan ng IBM sa privacy. Maaaring tingnan ang IBM "
"Privacy Statement [dito.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) Maaaring "
"tingnan ng mga empleyado ng IBM ang IBM Internal Privacy Statement "
"[dito.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
